 "_comment": "Genesis seed pack (English) for the action map (V2-539). Same rules as es.json: unambiguous whole-utterance commands only; variants are separate entries; anything that could mean more than the mapped action stays out and goes to the model. · V2-682 — the possessive and the courtesy form were the whole hole. Measured on the operator's own English session (2026-09-12): «open the agenda» matched and «can you open MY agenda, please» did not, so a widget SHOW fell through to the model and from there to a Brain Worker that died on a provider 400. Spanish had the identical hole («abre mi agenda», «abreme la agenda»), which is why the fix lands in BOTH packs: this was never an English defect. Courtesy and modal forms are ENTRIES here, never something the matcher is allowed to understand (normalize.py doctrine). · V2-761 — the widget catalogue («Apps») joins as a panel tab; the operator calls it apps or widgets indifferently, so both words are entries. · V2-764 — the `torrent` widget merged into `archivos` (section Torrents): its names open that section. · v15 (demo pass 2026-09-28, V3) — «make it fullscreen» over the video had no entry, the model said «going fullscreen now» and called nothing: a pronoun fullscreen targets the card in front (`*`).",
